        "text": "STOP PROMPTING. START LOOPING.\n\nI found a site that collects the most used loops by the community\n\n→ https://t.co/5XrXv9OpC5\n\nClaude Code's own creators say it: the future isn't prompting, it's designing loops.\n\nDon't know what they are or how to create them?\n\nThis article explains it in detail👇",
