      "id": "2066112954882224390",
      "text": "Claude Fable 5 + Opus 4.8 \n\nBefore Fable 5 was disabled, I asked Fable to build a landing page for a coffee store that showcases three models: Fable 5, Opus 4.8, and Sonnet 4.6. \n\nI didn’t want to leave things unfinished, so I’m using Opus 4.8 today to make iterations and add the final touches. \n\nMy favorite part is the interactive liquid hero, a WebGL fluid simulation. I can pour in matcha latter to fill the hero section. Fable helped me build the core interaction before it got shut down. □",
