      "text": "THIS CHINESE TRADER USED CLAUDE FABLE 5 TO BUILD A TRADING BOT\n\nAnd recorded this complete tutorial where he shows how to replicate it from scratch\n\n31 minutes. Step by step. Free.\n\nSubtitled in Spanish and English.\n\nSave it, you'll thank me later 🔖 https://t.co/PpHlsjt0zn",
