        "id": "2066035968197468340",
        "text": "How I build with Claude Fable 5👇\n\n1. WebGL line particles = the hyperspeed tunnel every energy brand wants\n\n2. Vanishing point = particles moving along the z-axis toward camera\n\n3. Additive blending = light beams glow brighter where they stack\n\n4. Bloom post-processing = flat pixels become cinematic light bleed\n\n5. Navy plus electric cyan = highest contrast energy palette\n\n6. requestAnimationFrame = tunnel feels alive and infinite\n\nSave this 🔵",
        "author": {
          "screenName": "Oluwaphilemon1",
          "name": "FHILY👑"
        }
      }
    },
